<h1>{{ title }}</h1>
<p>The optional <code>.kh-collage</code> figure draws on the supplied TurboGrafx-16 advertisement: unequal image shards, a black angular anchor, a small colour overlap and paper gaps. The complete image and upright caption carry the meaning. Decorative crops disappear in CSS-off and print modes.</p>
